    {
      "title": "TEST PROCEDURE",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "key": "test_procedure",
          "label": "Test Procedure",
          "default": "The test procedure was in accordance with EN 61000-4-6:2023 & IEC 61000-4-6:2023.\n\nPower Line:\nThe EUT was tested in the CRF test site with a GRP. The EUT was placed on a 0.1 m insulation support on the GRP. The cables between the coupling and decoupling devices and the EUT was kept as short as possible, and it was neither bundled nor wrapped and the cable was kept 30mm above the reference ground plane. The power supply to the EUT was fed through a CDN which is bonded to the GRP. The RF power from the signal source was amplified and fed through the RF input port of the CDN and superimposed on the power lines of the EUT with reference to ground plane."
        }
      ]
